                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="rZqj7GU-9iT7v_5y1c8X-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1" value="&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;The flowchart outlines the &lt;b&gt;Moderator Dashboard&lt;/b&gt; architecture, which handles operational moderation across three main modules linked to their respective databases&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;In &lt;b&gt;User Management&lt;/b&gt;, moderators can view user accounts, inspect user details, and take enforcement actions like banning or unbanning users&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;In &lt;b&gt;Product Management&lt;/b&gt;, moderators can view product listings, view product reviews, and select specific products to edit or delete&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;In &lt;b&gt;Reports and Feedback Management&lt;/b&gt;, moderators can monitor system activity by viewing usage reports and user feedback reports&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;Finally, all moderation activity streams converge at a centralized &lt;b&gt;Logout&lt;/b&gt; step to end the session&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="200" width="1090" x="-60" y="1150" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
